# Empty by design. Do not put real credentials in source control.
# Root-owned /etc/trader/credentials.env, mode 0600; systemd reads it before User=trader.
# Review the other PC's file before copying. Use simple KEY=value lines, no shell commands.
# Allowed metadata names: AI_PROVIDER, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_MODEL,
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_MODEL. AI_PROVIDER is ANTHROPIC or OPENROUTER.
# Key presence is REGISTERED_UNVERIFIED, with external_calls=false, OFFLINE_TEST.
# No actual account or model call is authorized by installing this template.
# Paid generation requires separate explicit authorization, user limits and a
# qualified worker. This service does not attach or activate that worker.
